#: lesson.yml:title
msgid "Statistical errors in MD"
msgstr "MD における統計誤差"

#: lesson.yml:description
msgid ""
"How to calculate errors on averages calculated from unbiased and biased MD "
"simulations using the method of block averages."
msgstr ""
"Block Averaging 法を用いて、Unbiased MD および Biased MD シミュレーションから求めた平均値の誤差を計算する方法。"

